<div id="block-athex-content--3">
  
    
      
<article>

  
    

  
  <div>
    
      <div>
              <div>


<div class="TextTitle blue">
	<div class="container TextTitleContainer">
		<div class="row">
							<div class="col-12 col-lg-8 title white">
					<span class="subheading weightLight textColorDarkGrey">
            <div>EURONEXT SECURITIES ATHENS</div>
      </span>
					<span class="heading1 textColorBrand weightBoldBook">
            <div><p>Initial Recording of Securities for Non-Listed Issuers (register@Euronext Securities Athens)&nbsp;</p></div>
      </span>
				</div>
					</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>


<div class="container table-container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 table-color ">
            <div>


<div class="container textBtext ">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-12">
							<div class="body2  textColorBlack weightBook text-item-body"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>The service of Initial Recording of a company’s non-listed securities with Euronext Securities Athens is addressed to Greek Sociétés Anonymes Companies ("Issuers") wishing to register their securities, shares or bonds, in a Central Securities Depository, in accordance with article 12 of Law 4569/2018.</strong></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>Basic Conditions for Receiving the Service</strong></h5><ul><li data-list-item-id="e07961bb7503262311626f6e9ece84ca8">Statutory provision for the possibility of recording of securities with a Central Securities Depository (CSD)</li><li data-list-item-id="e2b063a2299066386f513317b9c7cc27a">Freely transferable and fully paid securities&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="ec53ef4226329c03f975cc32a5cba3ca2">Fulfilling the obligation to publish annual financial statements&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="e8cf787a0e1b8f8761b75b8ab3093d15c">Receipt for cancellation by the Company of all the securities of the beneficiaries, where applicable&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="ee616d5cadc9e569ae04d9fe2c1c9c36e">Safekeeping of non-listed securities of eligible Shareholders/Bondholders in an individual Securities Account, omnibus Securities Account or Joint Investor Securities Account in the DSS system through an Euronext Securities Athens Participant<br>&nbsp;</li></ul></div>
					</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
                            <div class="exploreMore "></div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>


<div class="container">
	<div class="row benefitsgrouprow">
		<div class="benefitTitle heading3 textColorBrand weightBoldBook">
            <div>Benefits</div>
      </div>
		<div class="benefit-items col-12 col-lg-12">
			<div class="benefitItems">
      <div>
              <div>
<div class="benefit-item col-11">
	<div class="fisrt-row">
		<div class="benefit-image">
            <div>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/2026-03/new-athex-site-icons-fnl-05_6.png" width="134" height="134" alt="institutional icon " />

</div>
      </div>
		<div class="benefit-label"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="benefit-body">
            <div>Reliable registry of shares/bonds with the validity of Euronext Securities Athens. It provides security and enhances the Company&#039;s image for the purposes of participation in tender offers, M&amp;A, financing, etc.</div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>
<div class="benefit-item col-11">
	<div class="fisrt-row">
		<div class="benefit-image">
            <div>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/2026-03/new-athex-site-icons-fnl-01_16.png" width="134" height="134" alt="Total cover" />

</div>
      </div>
		<div class="benefit-label"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="benefit-body">
            <div>Ability to hold the non-listed securities of the beneficiaries in a Joint Investor Securities Account, which:<br />
is provided only by a CSD and is governed by similar provisions to those of joint bank accounts, especially with regard to inheritance and tax issues. In addition, it is combined with the securities blocking service for safekeeping purposes by Euronext Securities Athens (&quot;Safe Box&quot;), at the instruction the 1st joint beneficiary.</div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>
<div class="benefit-item col-11">
	<div class="fisrt-row">
		<div class="benefit-image">
            <div>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/2026-03/new-athex-site-icons-fnl-06_6.png" width="134" height="134" alt="financing" />

</div>
      </div>
		<div class="benefit-label"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="benefit-body">
            <div>Facilitate the financing of the beneficiaries of non-listed securities by enabling the pledging of securities by Credit Institutions through the Dematerialized Securities System (DSS) of Euronext Securities Athens.</div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>
<div class="benefit-item col-11">
	<div class="fisrt-row">
		<div class="benefit-image">
            <div>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/2026-03/new-athex-site-icons-fnl-04_8.png" width="134" height="134" alt="familiarization" />

</div>
      </div>
		<div class="benefit-label"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="benefit-body">
            <div>Familiarization of non-listed Issuers with the Greek Capital Market. The service acts as a gateway to familiarize non-listed Issuers with the services of Euronext Athens and the Greek Capital Market ecosystem for their further utilization (e.g. future listing on the Euronext Athens for raising funds, etc.).</div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
          </div>
  </div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>


<div class="container table-container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 table-color purple">
            <div>


<div class="container textBtext ">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-12">
							<div class="body2  textColorBlack weightBook text-item-body"><p><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-08/registeratEuronextSecuritiesAthens-brochure082026.pdf">Download brochure (Available only in Greek)</a> <a href="/sites/default/files/2026-08/registeratEuronextSecuritiesAthens-brochure082026.pdf"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/icons_download_60_new60-60_169.png" data-entity-uuid="567090ef-51be-40c6-ba8f-0c024ef2c689" data-entity-type="file" width="60" height="60" loading="lazy"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-08/Register_Euronext_Securities_Athens_Presentation_04082026_Site.pdf">Download the detailed presentation (Available only in Greek)</a> <a href="/sites/default/files/2026-08/Register_Euronext_Securities_Athens_Presentation_04082026_Site.pdf"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/icons_download_60_new60-60_169.png" data-entity-uuid="567090ef-51be-40c6-ba8f-0c024ef2c689" data-entity-type="file" width="60" height="60" loading="lazy"></a></p></div>
					</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
                            <div class="exploreMore blue"></div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>


<div class="container table-container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 table-color ">
            <div>


<div class="container textBtext ">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-12">
							<div class="body2  textColorBlack weightBook text-item-body"><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Procedure for Initial Registration of Non-Listed Issuers in Euronext Securities Athens</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choose "<strong>REGISTER YOUR COMPANY</strong>" to register and obtain password to a <strong>secure </strong>and <strong>easy-to-use electronic communication system with Euronext Securities Athens</strong> (available only in Greek), in order to:&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-list-item-id="e4904770d8888742778c26dee5c20676b"><strong>Be informed</strong> in detail about the <strong>application procedure</strong> for the Initial Recording of your company on Euronext Securities Athens and the <strong>detailed </strong>fees&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="ec025b2f42d287b2c8e13daa28d808d3f"><strong>Submit </strong>the <strong>application </strong>and the requested <strong>documents </strong>to receive the relevant Euronext Securities Athens services&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="ea146d748d6ff7935aa30b465e113c520"><strong>Be informed</strong> about the <strong>status of the processing of the application</strong> and the <strong>required actions</strong> per stage &nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="e8adae11b4c99a01c149dbc688db03f87"><strong>Pay online Euronext's Securities Athens charges</strong> for receiving the services after the application is accepted&nbsp;</li><li data-list-item-id="eea552df543eb2eceb4521a508fbe4d41"><strong>Receive support from Euronext Securities Athens</strong> at all stages until completion of the initial registration of your company’s securities<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><a href="https://www.eventora.com/el/Events/euronext-securities-athens/WebApp/Live/register"><img src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/eventora-buttons-08%201.png" data-entity-uuid="db32c571-e1e5-46ad-b3c1-7ccd15abde95" data-entity-type="file" alt="register your company" width="300" height="83" class="align-center" loading="lazy"></a></div>
					</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
                            <div class="exploreMore black"></div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div>


<div class="container faq-container">
			<span class="heading8 textColorBrand weightBoldBook">
            <div>More Information</div>
      </span>
	
	
      <div>
              <div>
      <div>
              <div class="faq-container">
          <div class="faq-item">
            
              <h2 class="faq-toggle heading6 weightBoldBook textColorBrand">
            <div>Information regarding maintenance of non-listed securities in Securities Accounts in DSS</div>
      <span class="toggle-icon"></span></h2>

                                      <div class="faq-content textColorBrandDefault body2">
                <div class="tabContent">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-10">
                    <span class="faqbody textBtext">
            <div><p>For more information regarding maintenance of non-listed securities in Securities Accounts in DSS through a Participant of Euronext Securities Athens, read <a href="/sites/default/files/2026-04/Euronext_Securities_Athens_Πληροφορίες_τήρησης_μη_εισηγμένων_τίτλων_σε_Λογαριασμό_Αξιογράφων_στo_ΣΑΤ_V1_0_EN.pdf">here</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      </span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-2 downloadFile">
                                        
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
                      </div>
        </div>
          </div>
  </div>
              <div>
      <div>
              <div class="faq-container">
          <div class="faq-item">
            
              <h2 class="faq-toggle heading6 weightBoldBook textColorBrand">
            <div>Participants who provide services to beneficiaries of non-listed securities (Shares or/and Bonds)</div>
      <span class="toggle-icon"></span></h2>

                                      <div class="faq-content textColorBrandDefault body2">
                <div class="tabContent">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-10">
                    <span class="faqbody textBtext">
            <div><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Participant Code in DSS</strong></td><td><strong>Name of Participant</strong></td><td><strong>Ability to remotely create an individual Securities Account or Joint Investor Securities Account in DSS</strong><br><strong>(without personal physical presence)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>102</td><td><a href="http://www.piraeus-sec.gr/">PIRAEUS SECURITIES S. A.</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>105</td><td><a href="http://www.alphafinance.gr/">ALPHA FINANCE INVESTMENT SERVICES SINGLE MEMBER SA</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>111</td><td><a href="http://www.hellenicamerican.gr/">HELLENIC AMERICAN SECURITIES S.A.</a></td><td>YES</td></tr><tr><td>119</td><td><a href="http://www.chryssochoidis.gr/">N. CHRYSSOCHOIDIS STOCK BROKERAGE I.S.S.A.&nbsp;</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>122</td><td><a href="http://www.depolasaxe.gr/">LEON DEPOLAS SECURITIES S.A.</a></td><td>YES</td></tr><tr><td>123</td><td><a href="http://www.karamanofaxe.gr/">KARAMANOF SECURITIES &amp; INVESTMENT SERVICES S.A.&nbsp;</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>126</td><td><a href="http://www.pantelakis.gr/">PANTELAKIS SECURITIES S.A.</a></td><td>YES</td></tr><tr><td>128</td><td><a href="http://www.optimabank.gr/">OPTIMA BANK S.A.</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>130</td><td><a href="http://www.axonsec.gr/">AXON SECURITIES S.A.</a></td><td>YES</td></tr><tr><td>134</td><td><a href="http://www.nuntiuscapital.com/">NUNTIUS BROKERAGE AND INVESTMENT SERVICES SINGLE MEMBER S.A.</a></td><td>YES</td></tr><tr><td>138</td><td><a href="http://www.eurotrustsec.gr/">EUROTRUST INVESTMENT FIRM SA</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>139</td><td><a href="http://www.pervanas.gr/">G. A. PERVANAS SECURITIES- INVESTMENT SERVICES S.A.&nbsp;</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>142</td><td><a href="http://www.lavrentakis.gr/">ST. EM. LAVRENTAKIS SECURITIES S.A.</a></td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>154</td><td><a href="http://www.sarris-invest.gr/">A. SARRIS SECURITIES S.A.</a></td><td>YES</td></tr><tr><t